# docs/ is documentation, not a stow package.
#
# Stow only reads .stow-local-ignore from inside a package directory — the one at the
# repo root is NOT consulted when selecting packages, so `stow */` would otherwise
# symlink these guides into $HOME as ~/setup-local-llm.md and friends.
#
# Ignoring everything makes `stow docs` a harmless no-op.
.*
